    user's input, generate a JSON response that matches the following structure:\n{\n 
    \"taskType\": \"string\",\n  \"environmentType\": \"string\",\n  \"dialogueReply\":
    \"string\",\n  \"avatarRole\": { \"role\": \"string\", \"speakingSpeed\": \"string\",
    \"accent\": \"string\", \"attitude\": \"string\" },\n  \"scene\": { \"mode\":
    \"skybox\", \"skyboxUrl\": \"\" }\n}\nEnsure the output is ONLY the JSON object,
    no markdown, no conversational filler. The 'dialogueReply' should be in character
    based on the 'environmentType' and 'avatarRole.role'."
